          "url": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/7x24/2026-11-09/doc-iniyaqqn3526550.shtml"
        },
        {
          "time": "2026-11-09 07:08:28",
          "text": "现货黄金突破4070美元/盎司，日内持平。",
